[DOCUMENT]
TITLE: Temperature alarm requirements

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DEMO-SYS-001
TITLE: Indicate excessive temperature
STATEMENT: The software shall indicate whether an integer temperature reading requires an alarm.

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DEMO-SW-001
TITLE: Alarm at or above 50 C
STATEMENT: For every integer temperature at or above 50 degrees Celsius, alarm_required shall return true.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: DEMO-SYS-001

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: DEMO-SW-002
TITLE: No alarm below 50 C
STATEMENT: For every integer temperature below 50 degrees Celsius, alarm_required shall return false.
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  VALUE: DEMO-SYS-001
